Description: Calculates adjusted average hazard with survival weight,
    restricted mean survival time, and event rate from adjusted survival
    curves for censored time-to-event outcomes. The package also implements
    the augmented inverse probability of treatment weighting estimator used
    in the accompanying simulation study and application.
